SMD event plane and FTPC event plane, for both 200 GeV and 62 GeV.We see that the resolution at 62 GeV is enhanced with the combined reaction plane for most centralities, while no obvious improvement is observed at 200 GeV. This is because of the fact that the directed flow moves to larger pseudo-rapidity at higher beam energy; the FTPC thus becomes less helpful. The \(v_{1}\) result reported in this paper was obtained with the combined event plane for 62 GeV (\(v_{1}\)combined), and ZDC-SMD event plane for 200 GeV (\(v_{1}\)ZDC-SMD), respectively.

